{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01158","headline":"相和歌辞 猛虎行 · 张籍","name":"相和歌辞 猛虎行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山北山树冥冥，猛虎白日绕林行。\n向晚一身当道食，山中麋鹿尽无声。\n年年养子在深谷，雌雄上山不相逐。\n谷中近窟有山村，长向村家取黄犊。\n五陵年少不敢射，空来林下看行迹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}